            "title": "10. Limitation of Liability",
            "point1": "To the maximum extent permitted by law, BitTasker and its affiliates, officers, directors, employees, agents, and licensors shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, punitive, or exemplary damages, including but not limited to damages for loss of profits, goodwill, use, data, or other intangible losses, arising out of or relating to your use of the platform.",
