            "point3": "BitTasker's total liability to you for any and all claims arising out of or relating to these Terms or your use of the platform shall not exceed the greater of (a) the amount you have paid to BitTasker in service fees during the six months preceding the claim, or (b) one hundred dollars ($100).",
