            "title": "11. Indemnification",
            "point1": "You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless BitTasker, its affiliates, officers, directors, employees, agents, and licensors from and against any and all claims, damages, obligations, losses, liabilities, costs, and expenses (including reasonable attorney's fees) arising from:",
